{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-18。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"助學金\", \"運動器材\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Apple Pay\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"華南帳戶\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"NBA帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "前兩天去醫院看診，那掛號費與藥錢一共花了八百五十元，我是付的現金。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"醫療\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"醫院看診掛號費與藥錢\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-05-16\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-12。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"游泳\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"O-Bank\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"OPEN錢包\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "欸，上次那台舊相機終於賣掉了，轉帳進 OPEN錢包 3500 元，這算哪種收入啊？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"OPEN錢包\", \"description\": \"賣二手相機\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-12\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-02。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"配件\", \"債券利息\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"icash\", \"中信信用卡\", \"合庫帳戶\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"銀行存款\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛領到這個月的 salary，為了慶祝一下，我騎 Uber 去信義區逛街，用 icash 付了 180 元車資。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 180, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"icash\", \"description\": \"Uber 車資\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-12-02\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-01。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"夜市\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"全支付\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"郵局帳戶\", \"台灣Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "朋友還我之前幫他墊的教育課程費，轉入郵局帳戶 2000 元"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"教育\", \"account\": \"郵局帳戶\", \"description\": \"朋友還代墊教育課程費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-08-01\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-06。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"罰款\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"華南帳戶\", \"合庫帳戶\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"中信帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我上週二是不是去保險公司繳了保費？記得是用現金付的，大概兩千塊左右？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"還款\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"繳保險費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-01-02\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-14。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"業配\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣Pay\", \"合庫帳戶\", \"滙豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "說真的，我昨天是不是去遊樂園玩了一天？印象中好像付了 850 元的現金門票？這筆該算進其他收入嗎？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"遊樂園門票\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-01-13\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-23。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"推薦獎金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"全盈支付\", \"KOKO帳戶\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"台新帳戶\", \"郵局帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "欸那個... 上週跟朋友去迪士尼玩，他說他要還我門票錢，剛剛全盈支付秀到帳 1200 元，這算什麼收入啊？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"全盈支付\", \"description\": \"朋友還迪士尼門票錢\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-10-23\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-26。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"抽獎\", \"勞退\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"合庫帳戶\", \"永豐信用卡\", \"OPEN錢包\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "欸你講，上個月接案賺到那筆外快，我昨天拿去付機車油錢跟過路費，總共花掉 350 現鈔，這筆交通費幫我記一下啦"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 350, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"機車油錢跟過路費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-06-25\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-05。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"保健食品\", \"菸酒\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"LINE Bank\", \"郵局帳戶\", \"有錢卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛收到客戶匯還的欠款 5000 元，進到數位外幣帳戶"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 5000, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"description\": \"客戶匯還欠款\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-11-05\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-27。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"美甲\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Pi錢包\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"SnY帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，剛剛去早餐店買三明治跟飲料，用現金付了 85 塊，不過剛好收到之前兼職的薪水 3000 元也是現金，要幫我一併記下來嗎？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"收到兼職薪水\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-12-27\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"線上課程\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"華南帳戶\", \"富邦帳戶\", \"有錢卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛透過華南帳戶收到投資報酬 5000 元，拿來付修繕費"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 5000, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"華南帳戶\", \"description\": \"投資報酬\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-25\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-24。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"飲料\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"悠遊卡\", \"將來銀行\", \"街口支付\", \"星展信用卡\", \"LINE Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天下午跟 client 去 meeting，結果我舊疾復發胃痛到不行，直接去附近診所掛號拿藥，用街口付了 1200，這算醫療支出吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"醫療\", \"account\": \"街口支付\", \"description\": \"診所掛號拿藥\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-23\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-03-12。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"證照考試\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"悠遊卡\", \"樂天銀行\", \"美元帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哇賽，剛剛收到上週家教的薪水轉帳進樂天銀行，總共 3000 塊耶，終於可以拿去買那本一直想看的進階統計學教材了！"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"教育\", \"account\": \"樂天銀行\", \"description\": \"購買進階統計學教材\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-03-12\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-09-08。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"美容\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台新信用卡\", \"中信信用卡\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"富邦帳戶\", \"聯邦信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，剛看到 Richart 子帳戶進帳了一筆錢，是之前買的台積電股票配息，大概有 3500 塊吧，這下子可以請朋友吃頓好的了哈哈"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"Richart子帳戶\", \"description\": \"台積電股票配息\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-09-08\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-12。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"手錶\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"全支付\", \"樂天銀行\", \"數位外幣帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "午餐吃麵 150 現金"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 150, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"午餐吃麵\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-10-12\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-31。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"裝潢\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"兆豐帳戶\", \"外幣帳戶\", \"富邦信用卡\", \"證券交割戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "前兩天跟客戶去那家新開的日式燒肉店，最後由我結帳，刷了兆豐信用卡，總共花了 2850 元。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2850, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"兆豐帳戶\", \"description\": \"日式燒肉\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-29。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"國民年金\", \"鞋子\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"Apple Pay\", \"Google Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛用 Google Pay 轉帳還信用卡帳單，扣了 3500 元，麻煩幫我記一下這筆 expense 啦，感謝～"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"還款\", \"account\": \"Google Pay\", \"description\": \"信用卡帳單\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-05-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-28。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"彩券\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"外幣帳戶\", \"樂天銀行\", \"Samsung Pay\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"將來銀行\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上週五付的冷氣安裝分期尾款，樂天扣 1200"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"還款\", \"account\": \"樂天銀行\", \"description\": \"冷氣安裝分期尾款\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-12-21\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-13。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"夜店\", \"水費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Bank\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"橘子支付\", \"華南帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉唷，今天搭捷運真是塞爆了，累死我了。最後用現金付了 25 元車資，這交通费花得真不輕鬆。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 25, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"捷運車資\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-01-13\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"機車\", \"退休金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"全支付\", \"icash\", \"第一帳戶\", \"複委託帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "幫狗狗買高級乾糧花了 1200 元，用複委託帳戶轉帳"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"機車\", \"account\": \"複委託帳戶\", \"description\": \"狗狗高級乾糧\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-25\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-20。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"書籍\", \"按摩\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"證券交割戶\", \"Google Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎呀，今兒個真不錯，上週五幫鄰居看店兼職賺的那筆錢，剛剛透過 Google Pay 轉進來了，說是五百塊，這可算是把之前借給他的那點兒小錢連同工錢一起湊回來啦，當是欠款回收記著罷。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 500, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"Google Pay\", \"description\": \"上週五兼職看店工錢及借款回收\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-20\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-17。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"Costco\", \"基金收益\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"樂天信用卡\", \"一卡通\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"街口支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "兼職外快 3000 現金"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"外快\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-17\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-04。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"口罩\", \"補習班\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"SnY帳戶\", \"第一帳戶\", \"兆豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，我家毛孩最近真的超愛玩，昨天去寵物店買了個新的逗貓棒跟磨爪器，真是敗家但没办法，用兆豐信用卡刷了 850 元，這算娛樂吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"娛樂\", \"account\": \"兆豐信用卡\", \"description\": \"購買逗貓棒與磨爪器\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-02-03\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-08。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"醫美\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"第一帳戶\", \"樂天信用卡\", \"台新信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，上週末我爸轉了五千塊生活費給我，是用台新信用卡收的，這筆要記成日常開銷嗎？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 5000, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"台新信用卡\", \"description\": \"父親給予的生活費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-06-07\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-14。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"內衣\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"全支付\", \"銀行存款\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "領到獎金 12000 國金子"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 12000, \"category\": \"獎金\", \"account\": \"國金子帳戶\", \"description\": \"獎金\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-02-14\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-02。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"菸酒\", \"抽獎\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"樂天銀行\", \"LINE Bank\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個上個禮拜三參加的 AI 研討會，主辦單位說好像有抽獎活動，然後然後我好像有抽中什麼獎，然後獎金是 5000 元，然後是匯到我的台灣銀行帳戶，就是那個…那個獎金的錢啦"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 5000, \"category\": \"抽獎\", \"account\": \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"description\": \"AI 研討會抽獎獎金\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-09-23\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-28。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"代購\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"外幣帳戶\", \"兆豐帳戶\", \"證券交割戶\", \"NBA帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，今天開完 meeting 餓到不行，就去楼下吃了個簡餐墊墊肚子，用兆豐卡刷了 280 元。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 280, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"兆豐帳戶\", \"description\": \"簡餐\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-10-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-04。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"接案\", \"贊助\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"郵局帳戶\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"將來銀行\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上個月借給朋友的那筆錢，他今天終於連本帶利還我了，不過他只給了現金，說利息算 500 塊，總共拿回 10500 元，這 500 元利息要幫我記一下"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 500, \"category\": \"利息\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"朋友還款利息\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-04\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-31。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"禮物\", \"點數回饋\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"LINE Pay\", \"樂天銀行\", \"美元帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天賣掉那台舊相機，賣家匯了兩千塊到我的台灣銀行帳戶，這筆錢要記成點數回饋的收入"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"點數回饋\", \"account\": \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"description\": \"賣二手相機\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-10-30\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-17。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"停車費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"彰化帳戶\", \"將來銀行\", \"悠遊付\", \"第一帳戶\", \"Samsung Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "那個...就是...小偉之前借我的錢，他今天還我現鈔兩千元啦，那個...就是兩千塊..."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"小偉還款\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-12-17\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-09-17。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"尾牙\", \"交際\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣Pay\", \"街口支付\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"郵局帳戶\", \"兆豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "用郵局帳戶幫朋友代墊電影票，花了 300 元"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 300, \"category\": \"娛樂\", \"account\": \"郵局帳戶\", \"description\": \"代墊電影票\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-09-17\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-28。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"遺產\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"KOKO帳戶\", \"加密貨幣\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"兆豐信用卡\", \"元大信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哇賽，剛看到 KOKO 帳戶多了一點利息，剛好夠我上週六網購的那雙運動鞋付尾款耶，感覺這筆收入來得超及時！"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 150, \"category\": \"利息\", \"account\": \"KOKO帳戶\", \"description\": \"KOKO帳戶利息收入\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-02-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-15。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"軟體\", \"手續費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"悠遊付\", \"富邦信用卡\", \"LINE Pay\", \"複委託帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上週六搭捷運去台北，用富邦卡刷了兩百五，結果今天收到信用卡帳單顯示這筆被退回了，因為我誤刷了兩次，所以這筆退回要記進交通類的支出嗎？還是說這是退款？哎呀不管了，你就幫我記這筆退回的錢，當作是交通費的調整，金額是兩百五，用富邦信用卡。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 250, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"富邦信用卡\", \"description\": \"捷運票誤刷退款\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-06-15\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-04-27。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"手術\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"合庫帳戶\", \"兆豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上個禮拜五做家教領到的 4500 元剛轉進合庫帳戶"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 4500, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"合庫帳戶\", \"description\": \"家教薪水\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-04-24\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-03-11。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"裝潢\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Bank\", \"第一帳戶\", \"外幣帳戶\", \"富邦帳戶\", \"銀行存款\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "說真的，我昨天為了接那個兼差案子，跑去買那本參考書，是不是花了現金 350 元？這筆該算在教育上面吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 350, \"category\": \"教育\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"兼差參考書\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-03-10\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-09-22。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"管理費\", \"YT收益\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Samsung Pay\", \"美元帳戶\", \"中信帳戶\", \"玉山信用卡\", \"Richart\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個上個禮拜五賣掉一台舊筆電的錢啦，好像大概 3500 元吧，現金收的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"賣舊筆電\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-09-18\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-13。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"尾牙\", \"YT收益\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"第一帳戶\", \"全盈支付\", \"歐付寶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "媽媽剛轉了 2000 元零用錢到第一帳戶"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"零用錢\", \"account\": \"第一帳戶\", \"description\": \"媽媽轉零用錢\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-13\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"酒店\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣Pay\", \"星展信用卡\", \"國泰帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "呃，就是那個...就是那個上個禮拜五，對不對，然後公司那個...就是發了那個...嗯，就是這個月的薪水啦，好像是轉到那個...就是現金，對，就是現金啦，大概有 45,000 元吧，就是那個...嗯，對，就是薪水。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 45000, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"這個月薪水\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-07-18\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-26。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"交際\", \"鞋子\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"樂天信用卡\", \"土地銀行帳戶\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"彰化帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哇賽，上個月領到的年終獎金終於入帳了，總共 85000 元，是用樂天信用卡刷的投資型保險回饋，快幫我記下來"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 85000, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"樂天信用卡\", \"description\": \"年終獎金投資型保險回饋\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-01-26\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-27。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"小吃\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"複委託帳戶\", \"Apple Pay\", \"將來銀行\", \"土地銀行帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "朋友還我上次代墊的 dinner bill，轉了 800 元進複委託帳戶"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 800, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"複委託帳戶\", \"description\": \"朋友還代墊晚餐費用\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-02-27\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-07。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"基金收益\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"富邦帳戶\", \"複委託帳戶\", \"悠遊卡\", \"永豐帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上週三晚上跟朋友去那家新開的燒肉餐廳吃晚餐，最後用現金付了 1800 元，幫我記一下這筆支出。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1800, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"上週三燒肉晚餐\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-04-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-04。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"內衣\", \"教材\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"郵局帳戶\", \"icash\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"LINE Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我上個月是不是透過郵局帳戶收到一筆投資收益？好像是 2,500 元？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2500, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"郵局帳戶\", \"description\": \"投資收益\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-06-04\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-10。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"跑腿費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"兆豐信用卡\", \"大戶DAWHO\", \"星展信用卡\", \"全支付\", \"聯邦信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "朋友還我之前的投資款，透過全支付轉帳給我 5000 元"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 5000, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"全支付\", \"description\": \"朋友還投資款\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-12-10\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-03-14。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"美容\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"中信帳戶\", \"中信信用卡\", \"第一帳戶\", \"Samsung Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎唷，今天 lunch 去吃了那家新開的日式拉麵，味道不錯但有點貴，大概花了 280 元，我是用中信帳戶轉帳的，幫我記一下這筆娛樂支出啦。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 280, \"category\": \"娛樂\", \"account\": \"中信帳戶\", \"description\": \"日式拉麵午餐\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-03-14\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-30。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"保險理賠\", \"飲料\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"O-Bank\", \"中信帳戶\", \"樂天銀行\", \"台新信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "欸你猜怎麼著？公司發的季度獎金剛打到 O-Bank 了，整整 15000 塊耶！感覺可以拿去買那瓶很貴的保健食品了，哈哈。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 15000, \"category\": \"獎金\", \"account\": \"O-Bank\", \"description\": \"季度獎金\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-30\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-04。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"瓦斯費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"郵局帳戶\", \"Apple Pay\", \"LINE Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛把那個用不著的舊筆電在二手平台賣掉了，剛好收到轉帳 3500 元到郵局帳戶，當作這個月的零用錢好了，感覺還滿 OK 的啦。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"零用錢\", \"account\": \"郵局帳戶\", \"description\": \"賣二手筆電\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-02-04\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-19。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"油費\", \"績效獎金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"玉山信用卡\", \"中信信用卡\", \"Pi錢包\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我上週五教那個學生兩小時家教，他說是用中信信用卡轉帳給我的，大概一千二吧？這算是我的兼職收入嗎？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"中信信用卡\", \"description\": \"上週五家教兩小時\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-11-14\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-24。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"手術\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"國泰帳戶\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"iLeo帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個前天的事情啦，因為浴室水管爆了，所以請師傅來修繕，那個維修費大概 2500 元，是用國泰帳戶扣的，對不對？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2500, \"category\": \"手術\", \"account\": \"國泰帳戶\", \"description\": \"浴室水管修繕\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-11-22\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-04-30。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"稅金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"Richart\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"Samsung Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，前兩天為了修繕家裡漏水的水管，找師傅來搞了一整天，累死我了，結果師傅說因為我幫他擋了風雨心情好，還多找補了一筆當利息給我的滙豐信用卡，說是補償我等待的時間，這筆錢大概有兩千五百塊，真是哭笑不得，雖然修房子很煩，但能收到這種意外之財也算安慰吧，這筆收入要幫我記下來喔。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2500, \"category\": \"利息\", \"account\": \"滙豐信用卡\", \"description\": \"修繕水管師傅補償金\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-04-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-05。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"舞台劇\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"有錢卡\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"樂天銀行\", \"美元帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "朋友還我代墊的餐費 800 元，用國泰信用卡收帳"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 800, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"國泰信用卡\", \"description\": \"朋友還代墊餐費\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-05\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-22。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"跑腿費\", \"寵物用品\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"KOKO帳戶\", \"icash\", \"全支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，最近手頭緊，剛剛把之前那筆投資的獲利 1200 元轉出來，直接放進 icash 裡，感覺稍微鬆口气了啦。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"icash\", \"description\": \"投資獲利轉出\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-11-22\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-04-01。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"禮物\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"永豐帳戶\", \"兆豐信用卡\", \"永豐信用卡\", \"加密貨幣\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "今兒個阿媽給了我五百塊零用錢，是現金。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 500, \"category\": \"零用錢\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"阿媽給的零用錢\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-04-01\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-08。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"高爾夫\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"玉山帳戶\", \"渣打帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上週五去新竹出差搭高鐵，客戶終於把上次的款項匯進來了，大概 15000 元，直接進渣打帳戶，這筆算欠款回收吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 15000, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"渣打帳戶\", \"description\": \"新竹出差客戶匯款\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-01\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"展覽\", \"運費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台新信用卡\", \"富邦帳戶\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"證券交割戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "爸媽轉了 3000 元生活費到台新信用卡"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"台新信用卡\", \"description\": \"爸媽給的生活費\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-25\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-07。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"便當\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"悠遊卡\", \"台新信用卡\", \"LINE Bank\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "今天去診所看醫生，結果醫師說我身體狀況還不錯，開了一些維他命給我，雖然覺得有點小貴但為了健康也只好認了，最後用台新信用卡付了 850 元，這筆算其他類型的收入吧，因為是健康投資"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"台新信用卡\", \"description\": \"診所看醫生開維他命\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-10-07\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-28。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"基金收益\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"將來銀行\", \"富邦信用卡\", \"悠遊卡\", \"玉山信用卡\", \"兆豐帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，今天去補習班繳學費，用現金付了 3000 元，好貴啊"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"教育\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"補習班學費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-11-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"聯盟行銷\", \"按摩\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Pay\", \"中信信用卡\", \"證券交割戶\", \"渣打帳戶\", \"永豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我上週五是不是用 LINE Pay 繳了那一筆按摩的費用？好像是 1200 塊錢？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"按摩\", \"account\": \"LINE Pay\", \"description\": \"上週五按摩費用\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-02-20\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-26。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"美容\", \"清潔用品\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"日圓帳戶\", \"歐付寶\", \"永豐帳戶\", \"滙豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，那個 AI 研討會的午餐真是貴死了，用現金付了 350 元，吃完才覺得好撐啊。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 350, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"AI 研討會午餐\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-01-26\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-04-23。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"口罩\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"玉山信用卡\", \"大戶DAWHO\", \"Richart子帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛搭捷運回家，用 Richart子帳戶扣了 170 元，這是爸媽給的生活費裡的交通開銷"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 170, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"Richart子帳戶\", \"description\": \"搭捷運回家\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-04-23\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-04。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"證照考試\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"悠遊卡\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"Apple Pay\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"NBA帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，今天騎機車去中油加滿油，花了大概五百塊，真是心疼。不過還好早上收到 NBA 帳戶裡那筆投資分紅，大概兩萬五，心情好多了，快幫我記一下這筆收入。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 25000, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"NBA帳戶\", \"description\": \"投資分紅\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-04\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
