{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-13。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"眼科\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Pi錢包\", \"土地銀行帳戶\", \"Google Pay\", \"星展信用卡\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉今天 project deadline 前有點緊張，去 7-11 買個飯糰跟咖啡提提神，順便帶了幾包零食當下午茶 stash，最後用土地銀行帳戶扣了 450 元"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 450, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"土地銀行帳戶\", \"description\": \"7-11 飯糰咖啡與零食\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-11-13\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
