{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-01。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"牙醫\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台新帳戶\", \"LINE Pay\", \"LINE Bank\", \"中信信用卡\", \"國泰帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "雖然昨晚跟朋友去那家新開的日式燒肉店吃了頓大餐，但重點是上週五老闆終於把拖欠我的專案尾款 45000 元用現金發我了，幫我記一下這筆收入。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 45000, \"category\": \"薪水\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"專案尾款\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-06-26\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-02。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"文具用品\", \"稿費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"一卡通\", \"銀行存款\", \"O-Bank\", \"全支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個早上搭捷運的錢啦，好像大概 45 元吧，用 O-Bank 扣的，就是昨天早上出門的時候"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 45, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"O-Bank\", \"description\": \"早上搭捷運\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-06-01\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
