{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-19。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"國民年金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"樂天銀行\", \"元大信用卡\", \"LINE Pay\", \"永豐信用卡\", \"郵局帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天領到兼職薪水 8000 元，錢轉入永豐信用卡帳戶"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 8000, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"永豐信用卡\", \"description\": \"兼職薪水\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-18\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-04-28。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"遊戲主機\", \"SPA\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"Samsung Pay\", \"美元帳戶\", \"國泰信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎呀，今兒個去幫家裡那隻老狗買了些營養補給品，說是能活絡筋骨，算是一種娛樂消遣吧，總共花了 45 美金，我是用美元帳戶扣的款，你幫記一下唄。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 45, \"category\": \"娛樂\", \"account\": \"美元帳戶\", \"description\": \"寵物營養補給品\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-04-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-05。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"百貨\", \"股息\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Google Pay\", \"icash\", \"加密貨幣\", \"聯邦信用卡\", \"永豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我剛剛是不是刷了聯邦信用卡買線上課程？好像是 1200 元？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"教育\", \"account\": \"聯邦信用卡\", \"description\": \"線上課程\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-05\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
