{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-03。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"鞋子\", \"應酬\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"複委託帳戶\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"第一帳戶\", \"悠遊卡\", \"LINE Bank\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個昨天收到的銀行利息啦，好像大概 85 元吧"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 85, \"category\": \"利息\", \"account\": \"LINE Bank\", \"description\": \"銀行利息\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-11-02\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-10。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"聯盟行銷\", \"按摩\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Pay\", \"永豐帳戶\", \"中信信用卡\", \"國金子帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛爸媽匯了 5000 元生活費到中信信用卡，算作其他收入"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 5000, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"中信信用卡\", \"description\": \"爸媽給的生活費\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-06-10\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-20。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"西裝\", \"牙醫\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"樂天銀行\", \"NBA帳戶\", \"大戶DAWHO\", \"華南帳戶\", \"全支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，今天本來心情很差，為了讓自己開心一點，下午跑去信義區看了那部新上映的科幻片，結果剧情平淡無奇，真是浪費了時間和錢，不過回來看手機銀行通知，發現樂天銀行又發了 350 元的活存利息，這讓我的心情稍微好轉了一點，雖然金額不多，但畢竟是白賺的嘛，就幫我把這筆利息收入記一下吧"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 350, \"category\": \"利息\", \"account\": \"樂天銀行\", \"description\": \"活存利息\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-06-20\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-03。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"攝影費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"一卡通\", \"滙豐信用卡\", \"玉山信用卡\", \"外幣帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天跟爸媽領了這個月的 life cost，直接拿 cash 領了 3000，要記一下"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"爸媽給的生活費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-08-02\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-30。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"音樂\", \"中醫\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Bank\", \"Samsung Pay\", \"SnY帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "用 Samsung Pay 付了 800 元，那張爵士樂黑膠唱片，上個禮拜五到的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 800, \"category\": \"音樂\", \"account\": \"Samsung Pay\", \"description\": \"爵士樂黑膠唱片\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-24\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-09-29。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"眼科\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"證券交割戶\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"KOKO帳戶\", \"全支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上個月領的零用錢有 3000 元，當時是用現金拿的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3000, \"category\": \"零用錢\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"上個月領的零用錢\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-08-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-29。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"家用\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"全盈支付\", \"國泰帳戶\", \"iLeo帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "轉進國泰帳戶了那筆五萬的投資本金，退還的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 50000, \"category\": \"投資\", \"account\": \"國泰帳戶\", \"description\": \"投資本金退還\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-05。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"西裝\", \"YT收益\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"兆豐信用卡\", \"永豐信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，之前幫老王代墊的那套西裝尾款，他今天終於匯過來了！總共是 8500 元，直接轉進我的台灣銀行帳戶，這筆算是收回來的欠款啦，Thanks!"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 8500, \"category\": \"西裝\", \"account\": \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"description\": \"朋友代墊西裝款項回收\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-05-05\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-21。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"牙醫\", \"代購\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"大戶DAWHO\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"NBA帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "呃...就是那個，我昨天去幫人做家教賺的錢，大概有兩千元吧，然後是匯到台灣銀行帳戶的，阿那個就是兼職的錢啦，對啦對啦"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"description\": \"家教報酬\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-10-20\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-11-21。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"房租\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"有錢卡\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"中信帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我剛剛是不是用 OPEN錢包 在便利商店買了衛生紙跟零食？好像花了 350 元？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 350, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"OPEN錢包\", \"description\": \"便利商店購買衛生紙與零食\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-11-21\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-29。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"美甲\", \"雲端服務\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"將來銀行\", \"Samsung Pay\", \"元大信用卡\", \"KOKO帳戶\", \"彰化帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個買保健食品的錢啦，好像大概 850 元吧，用彰化帳戶付的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"雲端服務\", \"account\": \"彰化帳戶\", \"description\": \"買保健食品\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-12-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-03-10。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"YT收益\", \"電腦\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"聯邦信用卡\", \"富邦信用卡\", \"台新信用卡\", \"元大信用卡\", \"國泰帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "之前接的那個 freelance project 尾款 12000 元剛匯到元大信用卡，這筆算是兼職收入吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 12000, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"元大信用卡\", \"description\": \"freelance project 尾款\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-03-10\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"化妝品\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"永豐信用卡\", \"星展信用卡\", \"icash\", \"複委託帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個幫狗狗看醫生的錢啦，好像大概 1200 元吧，是用永豐信用卡付的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"交通\", \"account\": \"永豐信用卡\", \"description\": \"幫狗狗看醫生\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-05-25\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
