{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-13。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"寵物醫療\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Pay\", \"聯邦信用卡\", \"icash\", \"外幣帳戶\", \"街口支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "今兒個幫隔壁鄰居修了個電風扇，賺了五百塊，拿的是現金"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 500, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"修電風扇外快\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-13\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-10。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"相機\", \"攝影費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"LINE Bank\", \"全盈支付\", \"元大信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛為了修繕房屋漏水問題，請師傅來處理，花了 3500 元用現金支付。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"修繕房屋\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-12-10\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-12-15。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"酒吧\", \"中醫\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"兆豐帳戶\", \"渣打帳戶\", \"複委託帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "上週六去 7-11 掃貨了一堆 snacks 和 drinks，本來想用複委託帳戶付，結果發現那是上個月做 side hustle 領進來的 850 元，要記成一筆收入嗎？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"複委託帳戶\", \"description\": \"上個月 side hustle 收入\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-11-16\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-19。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"手機\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"橘子支付\", \"SnY帳戶\", \"加密貨幣\", \"全盈支付\", \"O-Bank\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "O-Bank 扣了 85 元雜費，日常類，今天"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 85, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"O-Bank\", \"description\": \"雜費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-01-19\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-04-19。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"雜誌\", \"管理費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"聯邦信用卡\", \"渣打帳戶\", \"全支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "朋友還我昨天代墊的 dinner 錢 2000 元，轉到全支付"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2000, \"category\": \"還款\", \"account\": \"全支付\", \"description\": \"朋友還代墊晚餐\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-04-19\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-05。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"百貨\", \"跑腿費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Apple Pay\", \"悠遊卡\", \"國泰信用卡\", \"O-Bank\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "阿那個就是…就是…那個上個禮拜三繳的醫療器材保養費啦，好像大概 1200 元吧，是用 O-Bank 付的，對不對"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 1200, \"category\": \"醫療\", \"account\": \"O-Bank\", \"description\": \"醫療器材保養費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-01-30\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-21。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"配件\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"永豐信用卡\", \"國金子帳戶\", \"台灣Pay\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "真累啊，早上去診所看醫生拿藥，用台灣Pay轉帳收到兼職收入 2500 元，這筆錢是補償我陪診的工時"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2500, \"category\": \"兼職\", \"account\": \"台灣Pay\", \"description\": \"陪診兼職收入\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-01-21\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-06-12。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"家居\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"Richart子帳戶\", \"大戶DAWHO\", \"將來銀行\", \"富邦信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "欸，我是不是昨天在二手平台賣掉那台舊相機，對方轉了 2500 塊現金給我？這筆算欠款回收嗎？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2500, \"category\": \"欠款回收\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"賣二手相機\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-06-11\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-03-15。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"水費\", \"健身\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台新信用卡\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\", \"O-Bank\", \"KOKO帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天去書局買了兩本小說，花了 680 元付現"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 680, \"category\": \"娛樂\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"買兩本小說\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-03-14\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-14。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"西裝\", \"機車\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"渣打帳戶\", \"加密貨幣\", \"O-Bank\", \"土地銀行帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，今兒個去郵局寄那批老照片的掛號費，花了三十五塊，是用現金付的。不過啊，昨天剛好在渣打帳戶收到上個月的薪水五萬兩千元，你幫我把這筆薪水記下來，掛號費就不用記了。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 52000, \"category\": \"薪水\", \"account\": \"渣打帳戶\", \"description\": \"上個月薪水\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-02-13\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
